# 2
@novel
The black ring. Faust thought it was funny you classified it as a bracelet. There’s some etching on it? You press down on the metal. It’s an uncomfortable object. Something’s wrong with it.
@adventure

# 3
@novel
You should leave it behind. There’s nothing you could do with it. Recollection would have a field day with it, but you have other priorities. You keep telling yourself these things but you find yourself shoving it into the bottom of your bag. 

FAUST: Hee~hee.
MOIRA: I do not understand what you find humorous about this.
FAUST: The writing. It’s so funny.
FAUST: “We will bind each other.”. Like, a wedding vow?
FAUST: Miss Aria took workaholic to a whole new level, Miss Moira.
MOIRA: Pardon?
FAUST: Any-ways~ Any-ways~
MOIRA: Faust. Can you shut up?
FAUST: Yes ma’am.
You have given up on understanding her.
MOIRA: Thank you.
@adventure

